<div style="font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px;">
  <h1 style="font-size: 20px;">Confirm your new email address</h1>
  <p>The Score account of <strong><%= user.email %></strong> asked to use
    <strong><%= new_email %></strong> from now on. Confirm that this address is yours, and the account changes to it.</p>
  <p style="margin: 24px 0;">
    <a href="<%= confirm_url %>"
       style="background: #4f46e5; color: #fff; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;">
      Use this address
    </a>
  </p>
  <p style="color: #666; font-size: 13px;">
    The link works once, for <%= hours %> hours. If you didn't ask for this, ignore this email: nothing changes.
  </p>
</div>
